              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalezo zinsuku indlu yakwaJuda iyohamba nendlu ka-Israyeli, futhi bayohlangana ndawonye besuka ezweni lasenyakatho baye ezweni engalinika okhokho benu njengefa.",
